data: {"id": "0b171e45c3784199-thinking-parallel_evidence-1472", "run_id": "0b171e45c3784199", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结论\n\n**1. 异常状态确认 (已恢复/当前异常/证据不足)**\n**结论：当前异常 (ImagePullBackOff / ImagePullFailed)**\n\n**2. 支持根因的证据**\n*   **根因事实：镜像不存在 (Image Not Found)**\n    *   **Events (kubectl_describe):** `kubelet` 返回了明确的错误日志：`Failed to pull image \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\": ... failed to resolve reference ... not found`。\n    *   **判定规则对应:** 完全符合 Runbook 中的判定规则 *\"Events 含 manifest unknown/not found | 镜像或 tag 不存在 | 高\"*。\n*   **生命周期一致性 (Metrics & K8s):*", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789441345449, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "0b171e45c3784199-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "0b171e45c3784199", "seq": 1473, "ts_ms": 1789441351938, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 35.698, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v07", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/0b171e45c3784199-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "62ba121f4deb7e7bb02ca747d5ee59b64aadad310cac1d47ec3a5134c75cea58", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "99ede2ecf7219e3164cbbc8858533523d084203759bfd0fddc717c536669158f"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

